{
    "title": "Zero Liquid Discharge, Air Emissions, and GHG Emissions",
    "summary": "The page covers three sections of a Business Responsibility & Sustainability Report. Section 5 confirms implementation of Zero Liquid Discharge across 100% of cement manufacturing units and bulk terminals. Section 6 provides air emissions data (NOx, SOx, Particulate Matter, Mercury) for FY 2024-25 and FY 2023-24, including units, values, a note on external assurance by BDO India LLP, and a note on Mercury being Below Detection Limit. Section 7 details greenhouse gas emissions (Scope 1 and Scope 2) and intensity metrics for both years, including total emissions, intensity per rupee of turnover, PPP-adjusted intensity, and intensity per tonne of cementitious material, with a note on external assurance by BDO India LLP, an explanation for increased Scope 1 emissions, and reporting criteria references.",
}
